      },
      "text": "The next morning, we begin the ascent to Aconcagua’s high camps. We move to Camp 1, called “Plaza Canadá.” Up until this point, we have been working on achieving optimal acclimatization, and now it’s time to make use of it. Our goal is to give everyone the best possible chance of reaching the summit.\n\nAccommodation: Double tent – Meals included: Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner"
